# D1 migrations must stay LF on every checkout. `wrangler d1 migrations apply --remote` sends the
# file verbatim, and D1's server-side statement splitter fails on CREATE TRIGGER ... BEGIN ... END
# bodies with CRLF line endings ("incomplete input: SQLITE_ERROR"). With core.autocrlf=true on
# Windows, git would otherwise rewrite them to CRLF in the working tree.
drizzle/migrations/*.sql text eol=lf
